# CEdit - text editor in character mode (Harbour-CUI)
# build.bat (Windows) builds it with the newest Harbour in D:\tools\harbour-core.
#   hbmk2 cedit.hbp
# Linux: the same with the hbmk2 of that Harbour (X11 for ht_keyDown()).

-w3 -es2
-ocedit
{win}cedit.rc

../../hbtui.hbc

cedit.prg
htcodeedit.prg
cebuffer.prg
cesyntax.prg
cetabs.prg
celarge.prg

{unix}-lX11
